AcceptanceCriteria.AC-VALIDATOR-FLOOR:
Each of these nine exits 0 after the change, run as the
command text named, not via bun run validate:ci: bun run
typecheck; bun run test; bun run validate:cli;
bun run ./scripts/validate-marketplace.ts;
bun run validate:examples; bun run validate:determinism;
bun run validate:packed; bun run validate:schema-reference;
bun run validate:skeleton-templates.
validate:teaching-surface is not required. Exit codes
are read from the command, never through a pipe.
